// hex_fit — the doorstep — refuse at authoring time what would not round-trip.
//
// `fits?` and `snap`. A continuous model parameter must be quantised to what the field
// distinguishes; off that grid a value is silently SNAPPED, not rejected, so the doorstep
// refuses it up front with a named reason, an offer of the nearest fitting alternative, and the
// residual. Also the `Draft` — a form carrying an embedded wall run.
//
// Entry point: re-exports `hexfit`, `hexdraft`.
use hexfit;
use hexdraft;
